<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, Tibetan-first original. No other-angle proposal or semantic judgment was read. Extraordinary is banked once; particular and the expanded circumstances frame remain distributed. First skye ba belongs to caused, second to happens. The three spatial expressions resolve as about, about, on; first and second med own their separate nothing, final med owns not exist. The first negative-scope yang owns at all; the second is omitted without claiming its force absent. Covered space is positively attested in HGM14472; the other dictionaries darkness is not grounds to correct GMR. Supplied All of, participants, modal can, any case of that, and we call remain unwrapped. C18:1132 appends an asterisk separator; C05/C15 do not. No new erratum is proposed and no source or hgm_gloss is changed.</div>
